v98 = """<size=21>The dust-covered wardrobe is reopened, and every vintage outfit awaits a reunion.

Upon opening the wardrobe, you will randomly obtain 1 unowned outfit from the designated pool. Outfits across different price tiers are categorized into groups, and different groups correspond to different drop rates.

-Default Rate Details
<color=#f26c1c>20%</color> chance to obtain outfits: <color=#df9e00ff>"Embroidered Bamboo, Blooming Shadows", "Celestial River at Dusk", "Narcissus", "Sangria Succulent"</color>
<color=#f26c1c>30%</color> chance to obtain outfits: <color=#df9e00ff>"Fluffy Korvatunturi", "Raindrop-Cleaving Blades", "Pinnacle of Virtue"</color>
<color=#f26c1c>50%</color> chance to obtain outfits: <color=#7967baff>"Speed Star", "Astral Luminous", "Vivi Sometimes Hides Her Molotovs", "Diamond Flower", "Swimsuit Idol", "Flying Phantom", "Athletics Rookie"</color>

Each outfit within the same group has an equal chance of being obtained. If all outfits in a certain group are already owned, that group will be skipped when drawing, and the remaining groups will be redistributed according to their original rate ratios.

If all outfits are owned, opening the wardrobe will directly convert into a random quantity of Credits, granting 700-1200 Credits:
Chance of obtaining 1200 Credits: 2%;
Chance of obtaining 1000 Credits: 5%;
Chance of obtaining 900 Credits: 18%;
Chance of obtaining 800 Credits: 45%;
Chance of obtaining 700 Credits: 30%.</size>"""

v99 = """<size=22><b>[Access Details]</b></size>
<color=#32434a><b>Custom Procurement - Doll</b> is a limited-time Doll recruitment event</color>.
<color=#f26c1c>※ During the event, the limited Elite Dolls "Suomi", "Ullrid", "Macchiato", "Daiyan", "Dushevnaya", "Centaureissi", "Clukay", "Mishti", "Vector", "Yoohee", "Zhaohui", "Springfield", "Peri", "Qiuhua", "Nikita", "Byuka", "Andoris", "Jiangyu", "Florence", "Lind", "Laia", "Lena", and "Robella" will be exclusively available from the [Custom Procurement - Doll] event. After the event ends, the above Elite Dolls will not be added to [Standard Procurement].</color>

- Elite Doll Probability Details:
In this access type, the base probability of obtaining an Elite Doll is <color=#EDA51C>[VAL1]</color>, and the combined probability of obtaining an Elite Doll (including guarantee) is <color=#EDA51C>[VAL2]</color>.

- Standard Doll and Weapon Probability Details:
In this access type, the base probability of obtaining a Standard Doll or Weapon is <color=#AC65E8>[VAL3]</color>, the base probability of obtaining a Standard Doll is <color=#AC65E8>[VAL4]</color>, the base probability of obtaining a Standard Weapon is <color=#AC65E8>[VAL5]</color>, and the combined probability of obtaining a Standard Doll or Weapon (including guarantee) is <color=#AC65E8>[VAL6]</color>.

- Detailed Access Rules
1. In this access type, every 10 accesses guarantees a Standard Doll, Weapon, or Elite Doll.
2. In this access type, if an Elite Doll is not obtained within 58 consecutive accesses, the probability of obtaining an Elite Doll increases, guaranteeing an Elite Doll every 80 accesses; if an Elite Doll is obtained at any time, the count is reset, and the probability of obtaining an Elite Doll returns to the base rate. If the Elite Doll obtained during this access is not the boosted Elite Doll of the current event, the next Elite Doll obtained will be guaranteed to be the boosted Elite Doll of the current event.
3. The guarantee counter for this access does not accumulate and is independent of other access types, having no mutual effect.
4. In this access type, each time a Retired Weapon is obtained, you will receive 2 Withdrawal Receipts; each time a Standard Doll or Weapon is obtained, you will receive 12 Redundant Pieces; each time an Elite Doll or Weapon is obtained, you will receive 60 Redundant Pieces.

- Duplicate Doll Conversion Rules
Regardless of how a duplicate Doll is obtained (including but not limited to access, exchange, event, etc.), the following conversion rules will apply:
1. When a duplicate Standard Doll is obtained, the 2nd to 7th times will convert into 30 corresponding Doll Neural Archives; from the 8th time onward, they will convert into 18 Redundant Pieces.
2. When a duplicate Elite Doll is obtained, the 2nd to 7th times will convert into 30 corresponding Doll Neural Archives; from the 8th time onward, they will convert into 90 Redundant Pieces."""

